  "prefLabel": "En 502.27 Utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 502.27 \"Utility\" means any \"public utility\" as defined in RSA 362:2 engaged in the manufacture, distribution, sale, transmission or transportation of gas in the state, as limited in RSA 362:4-b with respect to liquefied petroleum gas.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
